I'd say "no".  Also, what do you mean by "high-conduct".  Even as an
illiterate you'll find plenty (more than you can carry) of daggers and
you'll eventually have a found stack that is larger than your starting
stack.  Zap a cancellation wand at a bunch to help the stacking and
you should be able to machine-gun them.  If you are atheist then
getting your AC low enough for team ant is a challenge but pets can
help a lot, too.  A pair of large cats will help protect you from a
lot of the early monsters until you have a chance to get better AC
(and a full-grown purple worm is pretty formidable, also).  A mirror
works in a pinch as does a tooled horn or leather drum.

